#ASSERT `s 8A(4) the dispute is a re-employment dispute` `the reasonableness of the terms and conditions of a re-employment offer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8A(4) the dispute is a re-employment dispute` `the reasonableness of the amount of an employment assistance payment offered` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8A(4) the dispute is a re-employment dispute` `another matter` EQUALS JUST FALSE
