#ASSERT `s 8A(1) the last day on which the employee can notify the Commissioner of the re-employment dispute` `the reasonableness of the terms and conditions of a re-employment offer` (Date 31 1 2023) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8A(1) the employee notified the Commissioner in time` `denial of re-employment because the employee does not satisfy the eligibility criteria set out in section 7(1)` (Date 31 1 2023) (Date 28 2 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8A(1) the employee notified the Commissioner in time` `denial of re-employment because the employee does not satisfy the eligibility criteria set out in section 7(1)` (Date 31 1 2023) (Date 1 3 2023) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8A(1) the employee notified the Commissioner in time` `denial of re-employment because the employee does not satisfy the eligibility criteria set out in section 7(1)` (Date 31 1 2023) (Date 15 1 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8A(1) the employee notified the Commissioner in time` `the reasonableness of the terms and conditions of a re-employment offer` (Date 31 1 2023) (Date 1 3 2023) EQUALS NOTHING
